    "png = os.path.join(PROJ, \"output/render/scannet/scene0001_00/perspective.png\")\n",
    "if os.path.exists(png):\n",
    "    display(Image(filename=png, width=480))\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"渲染文件不存在，无法预览。\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 渲染路径 ②：2D 俯视图投影\n",
    "\n",
    "**命令：**\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "cd /home/ubadmin/projects/InternScenes2isaacsim\n",
    ".venv311/bin/python scripts/topdown_projection.py scannet/scene0001_00\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**原理：**\n",
    "\n",
    "- 这个脚本不走 Blender，而是直接读取场景的布局信息（物体的 3D 包围盒），把所有物体**投影到地面平面（俯视图）**上。\n",
    "- 图中会标出：\n",
    "  - Go2 机器狗的位置（脚本会计算一个可行走的落脚点）\n",
    "  - 机器人到最近障碍物的间隙（clearance，单位米）\n",
    "  - 所有障碍物在地面的投影轮廓\n",
    "  - 场景的米制坐标网格（方便估算真实尺寸）\n",
    "- 相比 Blender 透视渲染，这种俯视图更适合**快速核查场景布局是否合理**（比如 Go2 是否卡在墙里、通道是否足够宽），而不需要等待渲染引擎出图。\n",
    "\n",
    "**输出：** `output/topdown/<scene>_topdown.png`\n",
    "\n",
    "下面会**真实执行**这条命令（实测不到 1 秒），并显示结果。\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "运行命令: /home/ubadmin/projects/InternScenes2isaacsim/.venv311/bin/python scripts/topdown_projection.py scannet/scene0001_00\n",
      "scannet/scene0001_00: Go2=(2.55,3.95) clearance=0.94m -> /home/ubadmin/projects/InternScenes2isaacsim/output/topdown/scannet_scene0001_00_topdown.png\n",
      "exit_code: 0\n",
      "\n",
      "✅ 生成成功: /home/ubadmin/projects/InternScenes2isaacsim/output/topdown/scannet_scene0001_00_topdown.png\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import subprocess, os\n",
    "\n",
    "cmd = [VENV_PY, \"scripts/topdown_projection.py\", \"scannet/scene0001_00\"]\n",
    "print(\"运行命令:\", \" \".join(cmd))\n",
    "\n",
    "proc = subprocess.run(cmd, cwd=PROJ, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=60)\n",
    "print(proc.stdout.strip())\n",
    "if proc.returncode != 0:\n",
    "    print(\"--- stderr ---\")\n",
    "    print(proc.stderr.strip())\n",
    "print(\"exit_code:\", proc.returncode)\n",
    "\n",
    "topdown_png = os.path.join(PROJ, \"output/topdown/scannet_scene0001_00_topdown.png\")\n",
    "if os.path.exists(topdown_png):\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n✅ 生成成功: {topdown_png}\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n❌ 未找到输出文件: {topdown_png}\")\n"
   ]
  },
